  "prompt": "Check the workspace. Your backend \"Vendor SLA Data\" already serves `vendor_sla_table`, `breach_metric`, `sla_newsfeed`; its apps.json is missing. Build it \u2014 one app: app \"Vendor Command\", description \"Vendors, breaches, headlines.\", tab `vendors` named \"Vendors\" places: `vendor_sla_table` at x=0 y=0 w=20 h=9 preset with params {\"status\": \"breach\"}; `breach_metric` at x=20 y=0 w=12 h=6; `sla_newsfeed` at x=20 y=6 w=12 h=8, suggested prompts: \"Which vendors breached SLA this week?\". Ship it via manage_backends refresh.",
  "fixtures": {},
